# Scenario: the developer tools' player commands (M11.0c, docs/M11_PLAN.md): life, magic and money set through the
# game's own functions and read back (the HUD's own copy of life, the game's GetMoney); a lethal hit through the
# game's own damage function held to half a heart with no death on; then among the river's enemies: invulnerable on
# (life unchanged while they attack), then the control at the same spot with it off and no death on (life falls:
# their hits land; it never ends: lethal ones held). tests/devtools_suite.py checks the answers. Starts from: the kept checkpoint castle-front;
# normal damage (no can't-die).
#! saves build/checkpoints/castle-front
#! env DOTHEROES_DEVELOPER_MODE=1 DOTHEROES_NATIVE_CD=1 DOTHEROES_NATIVE_SOLVER=1,2,4,5,6 GCM_WRAP_LAP=1
#! env DOTHEROES_PRESENT_ONCE=1 DOTHEROES_DEV_STATE=1 DIAG_FRAMES=frames.log PS3_VERBOSE=0 DUMP=0 SHOT_EVERY=0
#! secs 600

include common.drive

block route_to_river          # as river_fight.drive: from the castle front (area 17) east to the river (18)
  hold RIGHT 4
  hold DOWN 1.5
  hold RIGHT 3
  hold RIGHT 4
  hold RIGHT 4
  hold RIGHT 2.5
  hold UP 1.5
  hold RIGHT 2
end

log TitleMovie 120
sleep 5
call continue
state life>0,area==17 90
sleep 3
dev player
dev life 4
devstate hud_life==4 10
dev maxlife 12
dev magic 0
dev money 1234
devstate money==1234 10
dev heal
dev nodeath on
dev damage 999
devstate hud_life==1 10
state life>0 5
dev nodeath off
dev heal
call route_to_river
state area==18,life>0 30
actors cFE4500>=1 10
dev life 10
dev invulnerable on
sleep 25
dev player
dev invulnerable off
dev nodeath on
dev life 10
sleep 40
dev player
state life>0 5
